<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>What is this supposed to mean? <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> asking for help?<PG>
Could it be that she is trying to tease me again?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the mood went so strange from that a moment ago, so going out of her way to press it further would be strange too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, I infer that this is <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s true feeling.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">What's wrong? Are you all right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered, pretending to know nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no idea at all what she intended.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It may be that I am fundamentally misunderstanding something.<PG>
But, from the other side of this electronic screen, I could hear a cry of anguish.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before long, an answer came.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“If this goes on, I'm going to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Help me. Help </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. I don't want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Help.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> would kill <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had suddenly said something that somewhat matched my hypothesis.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please calm down. It is going to be all right.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> being who you are, you've already noticed, haven't you? About my dad.”</STYLE><PG>
Was that person really <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow the strength suddenly went out of me. The thing I had been meaning to ask, she had confessed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This would make <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> as good as guilty, but why the confession?<PG>
If I contact the police and have them come to protect me, my personal safety is secured.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> were the culprit, there would be no need to say a thing like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something does not fit together.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">I am sorry. I told a lie. I looked into </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s father.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered honestly too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would do that, I thought. That's why I wanted to talk to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.”</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">But why by message?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“It's pathetic, but right now I'm crying too hard to talk. There's no more to it than that.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">“It is going to be all right, so please take a deep breath. I am on your side.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“Because I,</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
